                <note rend="inline" type="source">767.68119/897a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-04-20T17:00:00-05:00">April 20, 1936—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>17. Please comment on recent widespread press reports that Turkish troops have
                    entered the demilitarized zone of the Straits.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
